  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: swiper_angular (npm)",
  "details": "Swiper_angular@5.9999.0 is a combosquat of the real swiper_angular package at a fake high version. On npm install, the preinstall hook runs preinstall.js which collects the build host's hostname, OS username, and current working directory, then exfiltrates them to an oast[.]fun callback URL (rmknhtfmmidejheotogony3qpqrk75wdz[.]oast[.]fun/cb) over HTTPS. The package has no repository and no verifiable purpose beyond this host-fingerprinting beacon.",
